fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"mpegtsdemux/MpegTSBase.html#MpegTSBase:ignore-pcr","fragment":"\n\tignore-pcr\n\nIgnore PCR (Program Clock Reference) data from MPEG-TS PSI.\nThis can help with playback of some broken files.\n\n\tFlags :\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\tRead\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t/\t\t\n\t\t\t\tWrite\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\tDefault value :\tfalse\n\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.18\n\t\t\n"});